{"exercise_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S272-EXERCISE-272YE","hint_ordinal":1,"id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S272-HINT-272YE-01","provenance":{"basis":"active Hint macro associated with 272Ye","kind":"source-derived-hint-map"},"record_type":"hint","rights_id":"O007-RIGHTS-FREMLIN-DSL","schema_version":"1.1.0","segment_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S272-SEG-272YE","semantic_anchor":"272Ye","source_anchor":"272Ye","source_line_start":1295,"source_raw_tex_sha256":"a527f380ca0853bf2e54bc24af7fb530c32d56b635c870c773e8e5f09c793e26","source_text":"let $\\Tau_0$ be the subalgebra of $\\Sigma$\ngenerated by $\\{E_n:n\\in\\Bbb N\\}$ and $\\Tau$ the $\\sigma$-subalgebra of\n$\\Sigma$ generated by $\\{E_n:n\\in\\Bbb N\\}$.   Start by considering\n$X=\\chi E$ for $E\\in\\Tau_0$ and then $X=\\chi E$ for $E\\in\\Tau$.   Move\nfrom $\\eusm L^1(\\mu\\restrp\\Tau)$ to $\\eusm L^1(\\mu)$ by using conditional\nexpectations.","target_line_start":1322,"target_raw_tex_sha256":"b3c40643280353ee37823fd77091a8c60133884a0e9de6831d79e47cb3141943","target_text":"misalkan $\\Tau_0$ subaljabar $\\Sigma$ yang dibangkitkan\noleh $\\{E_n:n\\in\\Bbb N\\}$ dan $\\Tau$ subaljabar-sigma $\\Sigma$ yang\ndibangkitkan oleh $\\{E_n:n\\in\\Bbb N\\}$. Mulailah dengan meninjau\n$X=\\chi E$ untuk $E\\in\\Tau_0$, kemudian $X=\\chi E$ untuk $E\\in\\Tau$.\nBerpindahlah dari $\\eusm L^1(\\mu\\restrp\\Tau)$ ke $\\eusm L^1(\\mu)$ dengan\nmenggunakan ekspektasi bersyarat.","unit_id":"O007-FREMLIN-V2-S272"}
